sequenceDiagram
actor U as User
participant G as MainFrame
participant S as ExamScheduler
U->>G: Generate (5 days x 4 slots)
G->>S: generate(...)
S-->>G: Result(success=false, message)
G-->>U: message: why impossible, e.g. "at least 10 days are needed"
U->>G: increases days (or slots), Generate again
G->>S: generate(...)
S-->>G: Result(success=true, schedule)
G-->>U: "A valid schedule was found"
Note over U,S: Mandatory constraints are never relaxed. The goal "fewest days" tries 1..N days.
